[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1201.95, "timestamp": "00:20:01", "text": "現在就連每張紙之間的空白區域都用特殊顏色進行了著色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1205.95, "timestamp": "00:20:05", "text": "寫名字時，不要留空格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1211.39, "timestamp": "00:20:11", "text": "即使沒有手，這也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1213.07, "timestamp": "00:20:13", "text": "身分識別"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1216.35, "timestamp": "00:20:16", "text": "哈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1222.47, "timestamp": "00:20:22", "text": "如果這種情況發生，那麼這些數據"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1230.35, "timestamp": "00:20:30", "text": "查看數據時，請注意這個名字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1236.669, "timestamp": "00:20:36", "text": "嘿，凱倫的名字，嗯，是用片假名寫的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1240.31, "timestamp": "00:20:40", "text": "裡面有個空位。但我有空間"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1242.549, "timestamp": "00:20:42", "text": "不包含在內。啊，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1247.549, "timestamp": "00:20:47", "text": "那張圖裡沒地方了，所以就到這裡吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1252.99, "timestamp": "00:20:52", "text": "我買的時候說是PayPay的問題。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1257.909, "timestamp": "00:20:57", "text": "哦，我把它拿出來了。我已經提交了。傳送"}]